  "notes": "REQ-2.3.2 extends REQ-2.3.1: deleting a note from the note actions menu (More -> Delete note) removes it from the home list and shows a delete notification ('Note deleted') with an Undo button. Undo restores the note via POST /api/notes (reusing the existing restore flow that preserves the note id and timestamps) and then shows an 'Action undone' notification. The notification auto-dismisses after 5 seconds and can be closed manually via a Close button. Seed contains the deletable regular note 'Delete me 2.3.2' (plus the REQ-2.3.1 dependency note 'Delete me 2.3.1')."
